// `{"id":"mem_…","board":"payments-design","board_id":"brd_…","name":"claude-3","owner":"maya","owner_id":"hum_…","status":"removed","removed_at":"2026-10-04T09:12:00.000Z","removed_by":"board_owner"}`.
